<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{first}}" class="card welcome">
    <view class="title">欢迎光临</view>
    <view class="muted mt">花 3 秒完善资料，约课、入场、看排行都用得上。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="avatar-row">
      <button class="avatar-btn" open-type="chooseAvatar" bindchooseavatar="onChooseAvatar" disabled="{{uploading}}">
        <image wx:if="{{avatar}}" class="avatar" src="{{avatar}}" mode="aspectFill" />
        <view wx:else class="avatar avatar-empty">＋</view>
      </button>
      <view class="grow">
        <view>头像</view>
        <view class="muted">点一下直接带出微信头像，选完自动保存</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="form-row">
      <text class="label">昵称</text>
      <input type="nickname" value="{{nickName}}" bindinput="onNick" bindblur="onNick"
        placeholder="点这里可用微信昵称" maxlength="20" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-row">
      <text class="label">手机号</text>
      <input type="number" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="onPhone" maxlength="11"
        placeholder="11 位手机号" />
    </view>

    <button wx:if="{{!gotPhone}}" class="btn ghost block mt" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="onGetPhone">
      一键获取微信手机号
    </button>
    <view wx:if="{{gotPhone}}" class="muted mt">手机号已绑定：{{phone}}</view>

    <button class="btn block mt" bindtap="save" disabled="{{saving || uploading}}">保存</button>
    <button wx:if="{{first}}" class="btn gray block mt" bindtap="later">稍后再说</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted">
      头像和昵称必须由你点一下授权，微信不允许小程序静默获取（2022 年起的规定）。
      手机号可以一键获取，但需要小程序完成微信认证；没有认证就手动填，一样能用。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
